{"name": "Locomochi", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"More toys, more adventures!\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"60\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338240/extras/72a2ecb3bc7e2211503d39ab6c8d597d.webp?t=1786042578\" width=\"500\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're sitting on the living room floor, surrounded by your favorite toys. You've spent the whole afternoon building your little railway, building a city for your cute characters\u2026 Now is the time to grab the controls of your favorite locomotive and bring that world to life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"256\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338240/extras/a1df4ef59012337158f26bb394bdc351.poster.avif?t=1786042578\" width=\"532\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338240/extras/a1df4ef59012337158f26bb394bdc351.webm?t=1786042578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338240/extras/a1df4ef59012337158f26bb394bdc351.mp4?t=1786042578\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch tracks, attach and detach wagons, move platforms\u2026 Feel yourself immersed in a relaxing journey through handcrafted toy playsets filled with playful animals, friendly toy characters, and delightful little details waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-hidden=\"true\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"256\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338240/extras/b2c2b158bfd521a42a80d1d0d37d4dc6.poster.avif?t=1786042578\" width=\"532\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338240/extras/b2c2b158bfd521a42a80d1d0d37d4dc6.webm?t=1786042578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338240/extras/b2c2b158bfd521a42a80d1d0d37d4dc6.mp4?t=1786042578\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Cozy puzzles at your own pace\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"60\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338240/extras/32021dd181ea1297be60b4d4a67f25e6.webp?t=1786042578\" width=\"500\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's no rush in Locomochi. No timers, no pressure, and no punishment for experimenting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drive your little locomotive through a variety of puzzle layouts, figure out clever railway puzzles, and enjoy the satisfying moment when every wagon finally clicks into place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-hidden=\"true\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"256\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338240/extras/72b15f8f63b12d49fdd00926e697036b.poster.avif?t=1786042578\" width=\"532\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338240/extras/72b15f8f63b12d49fdd00926e697036b.webm?t=1786042578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338240/extras/72b15f8f63b12d49fdd00926e697036b.mp4?t=1786042578\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're solving your first delivery or tackling more elaborate challenges, every puzzle is designed to feel rewarding rather than frustrating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"More toys, more adventures!\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"60\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338240/extras/aa1d0770f667a89e4181edf8a1295696.webp?t=1786042578\" width=\"500\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every new world feels like opening a brand new toy box.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-hidden=\"true\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"256\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338240/extras/19e720fc647c8cb110dbb43ab360f975.poster.avif?t=1786042578\" width=\"532\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338240/extras/19e720fc647c8cb110dbb43ab360f975.webm?t=1786042578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338240/extras/19e720fc647c8cb110dbb43ab360f975.mp4?t=1786042578\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New trains, clever contraptions, playful challenges, and charming little places keep every journey feeling fresh, inviting you to experiment and discover new ways to solve each puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As your tiny railway grows, so does the world around it. Look closely and you'll notice that every scratch, drawing, and forgotten toy has a story of its own... quietly revealing the imagination that brought Locomochi to life.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Locomochi is a cozy and relaxing puzzle game where you control your favorite toy train. Deliver the right wagons, solve handcrafted railway puzzles, and explore a charming world full of adorable characters and wholesome adventures!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338240/7c8194b98c9949c90007c9a133cad2c9a8bbfa85/header.jpg?t=1786042578", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Cozy", "Puzzle", "Wholesome", "Cute", "Trains", "Exploration"], "developers": "Little Lantern Games", "publishers": "Little Lantern Games", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4338240", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "15 July 2026 - Request Access\n\n6 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/HiexjlAY5qw", "first_seen": 1784066400.0, "review_rank": 288}